## Advance, revisit, pause, and escalate

Advance only after two distinct qualifying full-scope independent passes at O008 revision 2 / O008-C1. Delayed success is separate and cannot be inferred from acquisition. If a prerequisite fails, execute its one prepared repair route and return to instruction. If the supported answer remains incomplete after two hints, show the missing step and stop treating it as a check. After two unsuccessful fresh independent attempts in one session, pause assessment, revisit the worked explanation, and arrange a fresh prepared attempt; do not drill exposed questions until they appear fluent. Close an interrupted session without acquisition claims.

If the notes conflict, ingestion state becomes blocked/stale, or a cited source claim cannot support a key, stop the affected block and route a `note_issue` to ingest with course 2026_2027/Winter_Semester/Comparative_Economics, note/heading, ingestion revision 2 and exact conflicting claim. If a learner offers a plausible answer outside prepared criteria, a key is ambiguous, a lesson explanation/teaching bridge is missing, or fresh variants are exhausted, route `plan_issue` to plan with O008, revision 2, O008-C1, P002/V002, item ID/version and exact missing decision. Continue unaffected objectives only if their prerequisites are satisfied. Teach owns actual evidence; this file supplies no learner outcome.

## Answer-free recall handoff

**Topic:** Evaluate political power, finance and business opportunities in the historical argument. **Start:** Begin a closed-note review with teach for O008 using [[03_Agents/2026_2027/Winter_Semester/Comparative_Economics/lessons/O008.md#Immediate and delayed checks]]; request a fresh prepared delayed item before recap. Teach sends only actual committed evidence IDs and exposure context. Recall determines the date and task synchronization; no due date is defined here.

## Content provenance and generation boundaries

Complete checked-note passages above are reused with only heading-depth, required relative figure-path relocation and explicit mathematical typography adaptation; exact origin/fingerprint and asset dependencies are in source_manifest.md. All earlier plan-created exercises/full keys and named evidence routes remain intact. Hypothetical arithmetic instantiates the included definitions and does not introduce empirical results or new academic claims. Only named prepared full-capability forms and their existing permitted pairs can certify acquisition/delayed evidence. Extra checked explanation/practice cannot replace a named full form or reassessment gate. Equivalent verified methods may meet the unchanged pre-answer criterion; ambiguous criteria or an exhausted fresh bank return to plan. The current objective revision is 2; item/criterion versions remain as explicitly stated above.
